// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`buildExtractionPrompt > matches the golden prompt for the invoice fixture 1`] = `
"You are a structured document information extractor.

Inspect the documents/images supplied by the user.

Extract only the requested fields.

Do not guess.

If a field cannot be reliably determined, set its value to null and describe why through the status and evidence fields.

Requested fields:

invoice_number
Meaning: 发票号码
Type: string
Required: yes
Description: 发票上明确标注的发票号码
Extraction rule:
找到明确标记为“发票号码”的值。不要将“发票代码”作为发票号码。

invoice_date
Meaning: 开票日期
Type: date
Required: yes

total_amount
Meaning: 价税合计
Type: number
Required: yes

For every field, determine one status: found, not_found, or ambiguous.

Return valid JSON only, with no commentary before or after it.

Expected format:

{
  "invoice_number": {
    "value": "string or null",
    "status": "found | not_found | ambiguous",
    "evidence": "short supporting text or null"
  },
  "invoice_date": {
    "value": "date string (YYYY-MM-DD) or null",
    "status": "found | not_found | ambiguous",
    "evidence": "short supporting text or null"
  },
  "total_amount": {
    "value": "number or null",
    "status": "found | not_found | ambiguous",
    "evidence": "short supporting text or null"
  }
}
"
`;
